      "writtenOn": "2024-12-04T01:17:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thank you Will, I am currently doing the base address masking in the create_watchpoint function(L172 in https://android-review.git.corp.google.com/c/kernel/common/+/3387737/1/mm/memory.c). I did it this way since the VMAs I need to track accesses to would likely not have a naturally-aligned base either. Do you think that doing it this way might cause issues? Thank you!",
